{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/862506-i-m-missing-something-beast-changing","id":862506,"title":"I'm Missing Something...Beast Changing?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-09T01:10:57-07:00","id":862506,"title":"I'm Missing Something...Beast Changing?","content":"Can...um....can they? Change? Into a Beast form? That would be really cool. I know that some powers, Atavisms I think, change you somewhat, but is there a way to be the Thing you are when you're in your Lair? Like, at all? Ever? If not, has anyone house ruled this and did it work? <br /> <br /> Sorry, I'm only now getting the new book. I haven't actually read anything since the first draft. Thanks for the help!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1101-blindst","name":"blindST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T01:17:55-07:00","id":862513,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>blindST</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/862506-i-m-missing-something-beast-changing#post862506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can...um....can they? Change? Into a Beast form? That would be really cool. I know that some powers, Atavisms I think, change you somewhat, but is there a way to be the Thing you are when you're in your Lair? Like, at all? Ever? If not, has anyone house ruled this and did it work? <br /> <br /> Sorry, I'm only now getting the new book. I haven't actually read anything since the first draft. Thanks for the help!</div> </div> </div> </div>A beast can change into a 'monster' form under the following conditions:<br /> <br /> They are within their Lair (they merge with the Horror)<br /> <br /> They are within an open Primordial Pathway (same again)<br /> <br /> They become an Incarnate (they draw the Horror into themselves, transcending what remained of their humanity to become an archetypal monster (as well as getting the ability to physically transform into their Horror when they want to.))","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T03:10:26-07:00","id":862537,"title":"","content":"A Horror is not a literal monster - at least not in the same sense that a werewolf or vampire is. Rather, its more of a Goetic demon (a la <i>Mage</i>) that's devoured and replaced the soul of a human. Born of the collective unconscious, such a creature's powers tend more to the psychic than to the physical. So full-on shapeshifting is out of the question for the average Beast.<br /> <br /> In many ways, this makes <b>Beast</b> a more subtle game than some of the other lines. Sure, a Beast can drag its victims into the Primordial Dream, where the Beast has actual fangs/claws/tentacles/etc. But the real supernatural horror in <i>Beast</i> is to look into another person's eyes . . . and the realization that what's looking back at you isn't human.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T03:17:45-07:00","id":862539,"title":"","content":"Plus it keeps the other-kin silliness to a minimum","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T04:47:46-07:00","id":862547,"title":"","content":"If anything <i>not </i>being in your monster form in your lair is the hard part.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-09T15:05:13-07:00","id":862787,"title":"","content":"Which is good, cause lord knows it would be a pain to justify any sort of hidden supernatural world around the time some family's last stand against way too many heroes had them turn into a kaiju tiger, a kraken, and fracking Rodan in the middle of time square.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-10T15:57:35-07:00","id":863366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/862506-i-m-missing-something-beast-changing?p=862539#post862539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Plus it keeps the other-kin silliness to a minimum</div> </div> </div> </div>...You do know that &quot;my cursed body is just a mask; my soul is that of another creature entirely&quot; is, like, the defining attribute of otherkin fetishism, right? Beast <i>gained</i> more status as &quot;An Otherkin Game&quot; when it went to the &quot;your Horror exists only on the Astral Plane, never the physical&quot; route.<br /> <br /> Hells, at this point, Beast has joined Changeling: The Dreaming as <i>the</i> most Otherkin-Friendly game in the Worlds of Darkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5487-voiddrifter","name":"VoidDrifter","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T22:23:39-07:00","id":866259,"title":"","content":"I heard somewhere that they could transform temporarily when the environment is similar or the same location as what the heart Chamber is based off of. I also heard that was shuffled out in the final version, which to me kinda sucks. I mean, can't I just have a little time Hulking out once I've made a place metaphorically fit the setting of the nightmare I am?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2992-crapcarp","name":"crapcarp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2992_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-15T23:23:16-07:00","id":866276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/862506-i-m-missing-something-beast-changing?p=866259#post866259\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I heard somewhere that they could transform temporarily when the environment is similar or the same location as what the heart Chamber is based off of. I also heard that was shuffled out in the final version, which to me kinda sucks.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Heart of the Lair is literally defined by its being abstracted away from resonance with a specific real place and merging with your Horror within an open Primordial Pathway to one of your Lair's Chambers has been a thing since the first Kickstarter draft. You heard wrong; be glad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T00:57:16-07:00","id":866304,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>crapcarp</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/862506-i-m-missing-something-beast-changing?p=866259#post866259\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I heard somewhere that they could transform temporarily when the environment is similar or the same location as what the heart Chamber is based off of. I also heard that was shuffled out in the final version, which to me kinda sucks. I mean, can't I just have a little time Hulking out once I've made a place metaphorically fit the setting of the nightmare I am?</div> </div> </div> </div>As Satchel while people have homebrewed it Beasts have never expressly been able to turn into their real form outside of the lair. That being said opening a primordial pathway in an area and causing an overlay does give you some time to be merged with your horror before the pathway closes again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T09:01:34-07:00","id":868471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/862506-i-m-missing-something-beast-changing?p=866304#post866304\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As Satchel while people have homebrewed it Beasts have never expressly been able to turn into their real form outside of the lair. That being said opening a primordial pathway in an area and causing an overlay does give you some time to be merged with your horror before the pathway closes again.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mind you, if you've got average human (i.e. 2) Resolve, you've only got 2 turns or 6 seconds of 'Horror form' time before the Pathway closes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T15:11:52-07:00","id":868804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/862506-i-m-missing-something-beast-changing?p=868471#post868471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mind you, if you've got average human (i.e. 2) Resolve, you've only got 2 turns or 6 seconds of 'Horror form' time before the Pathway closes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then again, Resolve is hands-down one of the most incentivized Traits to raise as a Beast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","cus